OL,5,G2100 The Great Escape: A Daring Plan
OL,6,     FIn this first episode, we reveal
OL,7,     Fhow the prisoners built three huge
OL,8,     Ftunnels and prepared 200 men for
OL,9,     Fescape.
OL,10,G2200 The Great Escape: Breakout
OL,11,     FRoger Bushell and the X Committee
OL,12,     Fare devastated when their Tunnel
OL,13,     Fis discovered and destroyed by the
OL,14,     Fferrets. Bushell decides to reopen
OL,15,     Fthe other tunnel.
OL,16,G2300 The Great Escape: Capture
OL,17,     FIn this third and final episode
OL,18,     Fthe escapees have fled in all
OL,19,     Fdirections, out of 200 who were
OL,20,     Ftrying to get out, 76 made their
OL,21,     Fescape.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/5
