OL,5,G0000 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FBea regains control of the women,
OL,7,     Fwith Sharon and Chrissie unable to
OL,8,     Fresist. Bea asks Pat to plant
OL,9,     Fdrugs in Sharon's cell. Doreen and
OL,10,     FLizzie testify at Caroline and
OL,11,     FVivienne's hearing.
OL,12,G0105 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FVivienne refuses to go to the
OL,14,     Frefuge and insists that Caroline
OL,15,     Fcomes home with her. In solitary,
OL,16,     FRos requests that Paul find out
OL,17,     Fwho the radio belongs to and
OL,18,     Freturn it to them.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG4/5
