OL,5,G0205 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FCaroline and Vivienne try to cover
OL,7,     Fup what they've done, but when the
OL,8,     Fcops question them again, Vivienne
OL,9,     Fconfesses. Police raid the house
OL,10,     Fwhere Tony is staying.
OL,11,G0310 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,12,     FPaul bails Tony out, who lies he
OL,13,     Fknew nothing about the drugs.
OL,14,     FSharon is unable to raise bail
OL,15,     Fmoney and is sent to Wentworth.
OL,16,     FVera stirs up trouble between Bea
OL,17,     Fand Sharon.
